 "text": "Hey, how are things with you? Start with a clean bed made with sheets rather than blankets, a few stands of tea and biscuits, and a little welcome card. Keep snacks out of the way, drinks in separate container that closes. It's quite charming when someone asks if they can use it. A note saying the password is on the welcome card is enough. People appreciate the surprise without feeling invaded. A small bouquet of fresh ones is lovely. Don't go overboard, they'll wilt fast.",
